    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37984" root="لمح" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَامِحٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمُوحٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمَّاحٌ</span></b>  <i>Lightning,</i> and a
star, <i>shining; gleaming; glistening:</i> (K:) [but
the second and third are intensive epithets, signifying <i>shining much; &amp;c.</i>] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْيَضُ لَمَّاحٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>Intensely white.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَامِحُ عِطْفَيْهِ</span> A <i>self-admiring</i> man, <i>who looks at his sides.</i> (M, F.)

